{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: the Heart of Hakkar takes damage during Blood Siphon, and breaking it ends the siphon",
  "contract": [
    "The tester saw the exposed Heart of Hakkar (92005) take no damage at all. On live (combat logs of 2026-08-02",
    "and 2026-08-24, Bronzebeard 2026-04-22) the raid deals 120k to 430k damage to the heart in every Blood Siphon",
    "(2118615) and none outside it, and each siphon ends at the heart's killing blow, which never kills it. Damage",
    "to the heart must lower its health and reach Hakkar (14834), and its breaking blow must end the siphon well",
    "before the scripted SIPHON_LENGTH of 20 s, while the heart stays at 1 health."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "location": {
    "map": 309,
    "x": -11787.4,
    "y": -1649.34,
    "z": 54.1017,
    "o": 4.76475,
    "ignore_access": true
  },
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 60
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "owner": "hero",
      "entry": 14834,
      "level": 63,
      "health": 5000000,
      "reaction": 2,
      "distance": 4
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
